'''1986 AFA World Cup''' was the 8th [[AFA World Cup]], the quadrennial international football tournament for men's senior national teams. It was held in [[Burawa]] from 31 May to 29 June 1986. [[Asikyira]] won the tournament for the second time, defeating [[Burawa]] 2–1 in the final at [[Iskhal Central Stadium]], while [[Balisca]] finished third and [[Zong]] finished fourth.

