== Venues ==
Eight stadiums in six cities hosted the tournament, with most matches staged in the greater [[Iskhal Megalopolis]]. The opening match was held at the [[People's Stadium of Kankadadka]], while the final was held at [[Iskhal Central Stadium]]. [[Iskhal National Stadium]] and [[Mazar National Stadium]] hosted the semifinals, and [[Qallahere Olympic Stadium]] hosted the third-place match.

