=== Round of 16 ===
The round of 16 opened with a series of controlled victories for the seeded teams. Asikyira defeated Bayara 2–0 in Kankadadka, while Balisca overpowered Kaneda 3–0 in Dhalaga. Burawa advanced with a 4–1 win over Jarin in Mazar, and Zong edged Sanyan 2–1 in Docol. Volisania kept a clean sheet in a 2–0 win over Nakamizu, United Midlands defeated Louyan 2–1 in Iskhal, Daras beat Orma 2–0 in Qallahere, and Galwa narrowly eliminated Aetolia 1–0 in Kankadadka.

=== Quarter-finals ===
The quarter-finals produced four distinct contests. Asikyira defeated United Midlands 1–0 at Iskhal National Stadium, while Balisca overcame Galwa 2–1 at Dhalaga People's Stadium. Burawa then defeated Daras 3–1 at Mazar National Stadium, and Zong completed the round by beating Volisania 2–1 at People's Stadium of Iskhal.

=== Semi-finals ===
The semi-finals confirmed the final pairing between Asikyira and Burawa. Asikyira defeated Balisca 1–0 at Iskhal National Stadium, while Zong's campaign ended in a 2–0 defeat against Burawa at Mazar National Stadium.

=== Match for third place ===
Balisca finished third after defeating Zong 2–0 in the match for third place at Qallahere Olympic Stadium.

=== Final ===
The final was played at Iskhal Central Stadium, where Asikyira defeated Burawa 2–1 to win the tournament.

